('111.39.c.9.C',3,'A population of 50 triples each year. Which function models it?','["f(x) = 3·50ˣ", "f(x) = 50·3ˣ", "f(x) = 50 + 3x", "f(x) = 150x"]'::jsonb,1,'Growth factor 3.','original'),
